                <mxCell id="step1" value="Step 1: Generate Training Data&lt;br&gt;• Groq LLM generates 2000+ questions&lt;br&gt;• 60% valid / 40% invalid&lt;br&gt;• From syllabus.json topics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
